# Ownership here mirrors the "usc-dev merge policy" ruleset.
#
# Review requirements are ENFORCED by that ruleset, not by this file:
# the ruleset's "require code owner review" is off, so CODEOWNERS only
# routes review requests. Keep the two in sync when either changes.
#
# Note: CODEOWNERS is last-match-wins, so order matters below.

* @gluwa/protocol

# Paths that merge without review. Listed with no owner so that no
# review is requested, matching the ruleset's exempt patterns.
/.github/
/scripts/
/cli/
/query-cli/
/docs/

# Release and promotion machinery, re-owned to match the ruleset's
# .github/**/*release*, *promot*, *propose* and *runtime-upgrade* globs.
/.github/check-promotion-is-safe.sh                  @gluwa/protocol
